OL,3,GNEWSAScot arrested in Thailand over
OL,4,A'phone theft mistake' loses flat and
OL,5,Ajob in wait for verdict
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Scottish backpacker who was arrested
OL,8,Fin Thailand after he was accused of
OL,9,Fstealing a mobile phone, faces another
OL,10,Fsix-week wait to find out if he will be
OL,11,Fallowed to return home.
OL,13,FRory McColl, 37, claimed he mistakenly
OL,14,Fpicked up a device belonging to a
OL,15,FGerman tourist from a bar in Bangkok
OL,16,Fthinking it was his own after arriving
OL,17,Fin the city in March.
OL,19,FThe father-of-one, from Edinburgh,
OL,20,Fspent two nights in a Thai jail, but
OL,21,Fseven separate court hearings have yet
OL,22,Fto produce an outcome.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
