OL,3,GNEWSAScot arrested in Thailand over
OL,4,A'phone theft mistake' loses flat and
OL,5,Ajob in wait for verdict
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo police officers testified that the
OL,8,Fincident was a "misunderstanding" on
OL,9,FThursday, however the case has now been
OL,10,Fcontinued for a final verdict on 9
OL,11,FDecember.
